WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.060 --> 00:00:02.560
[Roar]

00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:04.120
[Roar]

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:09.140
[Skull-Crawler roar]

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:10.760
[Kong Roar]

00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:12.040
C'mon!

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:12.820
Move!

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:14.820
 

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:21.500
[Roaring]

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:24.640
 

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:25.140
 

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:26.960
These

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:27.900
are photos

00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:29.940
of an island in the south pacific

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:32.440
A place where myth and science meet.

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:37.140
We use explosives to shake the earth

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:39.100
helping us to map the surface of the island

00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:40.600
You're dropping bombs?

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.260
Scientific instruments.

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:47.860
Is that a monkey?

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:55.800
[Kong Roars]

00:00:56.140 --> 00:00:56.780
Pull out!

00:01:05.140 --> 00:01:06.100
Magnificent.

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:09.040
You knew that thing was out here?!

00:01:09.120 --> 00:01:10.600
I'm sorry for your men colonel.

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:14.360
but if you want to make this sacrifice worthwhile

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:16.780
get us home

00:01:17.960 --> 00:01:18.820
with proof.

00:01:19.860 --> 00:01:21.080
Monsters exist.

00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:25.840
Woah woah woah woah woah

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:28.360
Your friend there can put that down.

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:31.860
What the hell is this place?

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:33.620
Thats Kong.

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:35.980
He's King around here.

00:01:36.880 --> 00:01:38.640
Kong's a pretty good king.

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:40.840
Keeps to himself, mostly.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.400
But you don't go into someones house

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:44.820
and start dropping bombs

00:01:44.820 --> 00:01:46.900
unless you're picking a fight.

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:49.520
Kong's god on the island,

00:01:49.740 --> 00:01:51.660
but the devils live below us.

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:55.460
And what are they called?

00:01:56.060 --> 00:01:57.740
I call them Skull-Crawlers.

00:01:58.060 --> 00:01:58.560
Why?

00:01:59.700 --> 00:02:00.980
Never said that name out loud before

00:02:00.980 --> 00:02:02.360
sounds stupid now that i say-

00:02:02.360 --> 00:02:03.880
just call them whatever you want.

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:05.400
[Skull-Crawler noise]

00:02:08.460 --> 00:02:09.520
[Skull-Crawler roar]

00:02:21.080 --> 00:02:22.300
[Kong roar]

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:25.480
[Kong roar]

00:02:25.640 --> 00:02:26.600
[Machine gun]

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:37.940
[Kong roars]

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:40.960
It's a good group of boys

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:42.700
we're all gonna die together, out here

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:43.500
[Laughter]

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:44.480
You shouldn't have come here.

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:45.960
[Skull-Crawler roar]

